$ | $12$ | $8$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $-2$ | $-8$ | $-8$ |\n|  | $1$ | $4$ | $4$ | $0$ |\n\n \nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(y) & =(y+2)({y}^{2}+4y+4) \\\\  & =(y+2)(y+2)^{2} \\\\  & =(y+2)^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $f(y)$ has exactly one equilibrium solution,\n\n$$\n{y}_{1}(t)=-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307464 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307465 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307466 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307467 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307468 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1041 "selection" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307466 13194139534748 true] [17592186307463 1110 #uuid "f0731521-4ddb-5ad4-914b-cf8cce8234e0" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307464 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307464 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534748 true] [17592186307464 1111 #uuid "2ab60e6c-bea9-5f2f-bb02-461b6337a953" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307465 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307465 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534748 true] [17592186307465 1111 #uuid "be4ba1fa-12b3-5be1-baaf-7d62c87ea971" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307466 1034 "I only" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307466 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534748 true] [17592186307466 1111 #uuid "b2f16027-1775-5bba-9c45-9d3fb347b4ce" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307467 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307467 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534748 true] [17592186307467 1111 #uuid "eba455c3-b642-552d-abf1-40f09ee229d2" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307468 1034 "II only" 13194139534748 true] [17592186307468 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534748 true] [17592186307468 1111 #uuid "87f6630a-29c8-58c8-8722-1138fcd84a40" 13194139534